IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`
IMPORT `uro-seat`

-- Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/148): CASES for the seat layer uro-seat.l4.
-- At least one case for every question. Each expected value is read by hand from the line of the text that states it
-- (the lines are cited in uro-tests-*.l4 beside the same figures); none is copied from the encoding's own output.
-- Where a case is one of several for the same question, the facts are chosen to show a boundary or the other branch.

